(7697779, 1262773, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine grungy, HDR-ish image.  The structures and interwoven gizmos have that deadly serious mien of assault and implacable degradation, even as it''s mission is eco-friendly.  Can this substitute itself for an horizon of distant mountains?  But even more so, it''s the sky, these boiling clouds again a parody of nature.  The photo is done so well that we can still appreciate the intricate beauty of the beast.  Gives one pause amongst deeper discomfort.<br/>Co- personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Fine grungy, HDR-ish image.  The structures and interwoven gizmos have that deadly serious mien of assault and implacable degradation, even as it''s mission is eco-friendly.  Can this substitute itself for an horizon of distant mountains?  But even more so, it''s the sky, these boiling clouds again a parody of nature.  The photo is done so well that we can still appreciate the intricate beauty of the beast.  Gives one pause amongst deeper discomfort.Co- personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-07-21 00:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
